PURPOSE of /kernel/misc/rtc-hwclock
Description: Test RTC using hwclock
Author: Erico Nunes <ernunes@redhat.com>



rtc-hwclock Introduction
========================

This is a simple test to test RTC functionality using the 'hwclock'
utility from util-linux.
The test will check whether setting a new time to the RTC works
combining different cases, like Daylight Saving and UTC/localtime
setting.
It will restore the correct time at the end by using the internal Red
Hat NTP server.
